---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Retired page"
  description="This page taught something the protocol no longer does, and was retired rather than patched."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="wrap" style="padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem) 0;">
    <p class="kicker">Retired</p>
    <h1 style="max-width: 18ch;">This page taught something that is no longer true.</h1>
    <p class="section-lede" style="margin-top: 1.3rem; font-size: 1.05rem;">
      You have followed a link to material from the previous Graph Academy. It described
      a version of the protocol that no longer exists, and it was retired rather than
      patched, because patching it would have left a confident page with a plausible
      shape and wrong contents.
    </p>
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top: 2.4rem;">
      <h2>What was retired, and why.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Hosted Service tutorials.</strong> The Hosted Service is gone.</li>
        <li><strong>Cobb-Douglas rebate mathematics.</strong> Replaced by exponential rebates in GIP-0051.</li>
        <li><strong>L1 curation bonding curve strategy.</strong> Curation on Arbitrum One uses a flat curve, so timing your entry does nothing.</li>
        <li><strong>Testnet and bare-metal indexer guides.</strong> Superseded, and the economics in them predate two protocol upgrades.</li>
        <li><strong>Delegation tax guidance.</strong> The tax was removed under Horizon.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Where to go instead.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The current curriculum: <a href="/catalogue/">collections</a>.</li>
        <li>Every current protocol number with its source: <a href="/parameters/">parameters</a>.</li>
        <li>Terms, including the obsolete ones you may have come here for: <a href="/glossary/">glossary</a>.</li>
        <li>Procedures and configuration: <a href="https://thegraph.com/docs/en/" rel="external noopener">the official documentation</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 2.4rem;">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/catalogue/">Browse the paths</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/start/">Start from the beginning</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
